{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02919","headline":"和陈元光平潮寇诗 · 许天正","name":"和陈元光平潮寇诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抱磴从天上，驱车返岭东。\n气昂无丑虏，策妙诎羣雄。\n飞絮随风散，余氛响日熔。\n长戈收百甲，聚骑破千重。\n落劒惟戎首，游绳系胁从。\n四野无坚壁，羣生未化融。\n龙湖膏泽下，早晚徧枯穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许天正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}